 the system inherit base functionality from.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="541884">base entity</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1298133">entiti asas</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="1285_143904_1711370"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A language used to interpret keystrokes from the keyboard, which can result in different characters appearing than what is printed on the physical keyboard.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="143904">keyboard language</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1711370">bahasa papan kekunci</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="12850_271514_1298134"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The purpose, driving factors, and background for building the system. The goal of the project vision is to align the team around a central purpose.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="271514">project vision</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1298134">wawasan projek</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><