ail contact</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1984721">kenalan mel</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="13878_187630_1298194"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A debugging feature that hides non-user code so that it does not appear in the debugger windows.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="187630">My Code</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1298194">Kod Saya</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="13880_535353_2196568"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A SELECT statement that is passed directly to the source database without modification or delay.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="535353">pass-through statement</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2196568">penyata serah terus</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="13883_43673_443508"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To detect, locate, and correct logical or syntactical errors in a program or malfunctions in hardware. In hardware contexts, the term troubleshoot is the term more often used, especially when the problem is a major one.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="43673">debug</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="443508">nyahpepijat</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="13886_186958_1298195"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The abstract type of an application server, which defines common characteristics of a class of logical application servers including the set of supported abstract endpoint definitions.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="186958">abstract server definition</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1298195">takrif pelayan abstrak</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="13888_237793_1183062"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A testing process that supplies structured but invalid input to software application programming interfaces (APIs) and network interfaces to maximize the likelihood of detecting errors that might lead to software vulnerabilities.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="23779