cted</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="14048_318759_444937"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The } character.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="318759">right brace</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="444937">tanda kurung dakap kanan</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="14049_237190_1298203"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Principles and processes that facilitate the management of change without compromising the quality or integrity of an IT project or solution, through structured procedures for submitting, approving, implementing, and reviewing change requests.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="237190">change control</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1298203">kawalan perubahan</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="14051_136919_444102"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Additional information required by some macro actions - for example, the object affected by the action or special conditions under which the action is carried out.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="136919">action argument</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="gramma