, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="18941_651347_1448264"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An actor's interface component through which actors communicate with other actors.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="651347">port</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1448264">port</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="18942_651778_1448265"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Any one-dimensional (1-D) shape that can be glued between two shapes in a drawing to connect the shapes.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="651778">connector</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1448265">penyambung</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="1898_67709_443682"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To load the program and installation files onto your computer or device so that the program runs correctly.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="67709">install</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNum