Number">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="1902_779009_443623"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Capable of using or being displayed on the full area of a display screen. Applications running in windowing environments, although they might use the entire area of the screen, commonly allocate different areas to different windows, any of which can be enlarged to fill the entire screen.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="779009">full-screen</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="443623">skrin penuh</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="191_182199_2177594"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A type of user account.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="182199">Everyone</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2177594">Semua Orang</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="1914_1060965_443540"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To make an entity nonfunctional.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1060965">turn off</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms">