e="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="19219_652191_1448268"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A date that you set [rather than the current date] for reporting the time, cost, or performance condition of a project.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="652191">status date</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1448268">tarikh status</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="1922_2618056_2121401"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The amount of money designated for an activity or task.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2618056">budget</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2121401">belanjawan diperuntukkan</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="1922_460666_2121401"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The amount of money designated for an activity or task.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="460666">budget allocated</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2121401">belanjawan diperuntukkan</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="19221_652193_1183127"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A description of the status of a member's project work and related work.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="652193">status report</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1183127">laporan status</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="19229_652201_1448269"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A task that is made up of subtasks and summarizes those subtasks. Use outlining to create summary tasks. Project automatically determines summary task information [such as duration and cost] by using information from the subtasks.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="652201">summary task</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1448269">tugas ringkasan</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="19231_652203_1096537"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A collection of a sample of data or opinions, considered to be representative of a whole.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="652203">survey</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1096537">tinjauan</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="19232_652204_1448270"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An horizontal or vertical line that divides a diagram into partitions and which is used to arrange related parts of a process.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="652204">swimlane</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1448270">laluan aktiviti</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="1925_182089_2175547"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The set of communication rules used to route notification messages to external delivery systems.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="182089">delivery protocol</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2175547">protokol penghantaran</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelecte