 to the use of licensed products, the misuse or any departure from the reasonable use of such products.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="724470">abuse</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2213485">penyalahgunaan</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="2029_20052_1679513"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A type of data contained in a PKCS #7 message. Base content types only contain data, no cryptographic enhancements such as hashes or signatures. Currently, the only base content type is the Data content type.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="20052">base content type</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1679513">jenis kandungan dasar</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="203_442_408820"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A digital document used for authentication and network security that binds a public key to an entity that holds the corresponding private key.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="442">certificate</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="408820">sijil</term><termNote type="geogr