ion of memory resources in SQL Server.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="725997">memory broker</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2189703">broker memori</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="20567_726004_1301307"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To protect a project from being affected by certain commands, for example, Check Out, Check In, and Undo Check Out.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="726004">cloak</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1301307">menyelubung</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="20595_726386_2020431"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A virtual community that provides people with opportunities to interact (via blogs, chats, newsgroups, webcasts, user groups, and forums) with Microsoft employees, experts, and peers in order to share knowledge and news about Microsoft technology.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="726386">Microsoft community</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2020431">komuniti Microsoft</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNo