 core processor that had been parked for power saving purpose.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="766812">unpark</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1183199">buka</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="21116_766813_1183200"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature of Windows Media Player that allows users to remove gaps between tracks that they burn to audio CDs.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="766813">gapless CD burning</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1183200">pembakaran tanpa sela</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="21116_766816_1183200"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature of Windows Media Player that allows users to remove gaps between tracks that they burn to audio CDs.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="766816">gapless burning</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1183200">pembakaran tanpa sela</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="21117_766814_1183201"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Existing in reference to the removal of silences or clicks between tracks when they are burnt to an audio CD or when they are played back from the CD.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="766814">gapless</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1183201">tanpa sela</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="21120_766842_1183202"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A unique identifier made from four otherwise separate pieces of information. For example, a color can be specified by a black, yellow, magenta and cyan quad.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="766842">quad</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1183202">kuad</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="21126_766858_1183203"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Any information (e.g. account numbers, sensitive data, etc.) with a title and some free-form text that can be stored in a secure manner in a personal vault.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="766858">secure note</term><termNote t