, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="22490_1045759_1183286"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An audio or video file that you rent from an online store, typically for a monthly fee.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1045759">subscription file</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1183286">fail langganan</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="22492_1045783_1183287"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A troubleshooter that performs common maintenance tasks in Windows, such as cleaning up unused files and shortcuts.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1045783">Maintenance troubleshooter</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1183287">penyelesai masalah Penyenggaraan</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="22493_1045790_1183288"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A troubleshooter that helps find and fix problems about hardware and devices.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1045790">Hardware and Devices troubleshoote