r email, instant messaging, photos, and personal movies available to customers in a single download and installation.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1136241">Windows Live Essentials</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1173511">Windows Live Essentials</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="24603_1136241_1676009"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The set of Microsoft software for email, instant messaging, photos, and personal movies available to customers in a single download and installation.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1136241">Windows Live Essentials</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1676009">Windows Essentials</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="24603_1636168_1173511"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The set of Microsoft software for email, instant messaging, photos, and personal movies available to customers in a single download and installation.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1636168">Windows Essentials</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1173511">Windows Live Essentials</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="24603_1636168_1676009"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The set of Microsoft software for email, instant messaging, photos, and personal movies available to customers in a single download and installation.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1636168">Windows Essentials</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1676009">Windows Essentials</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="24604_1136243_1173510"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Windows Live universal roaming contact list that allows users to share their contact information and subscribe to others’ to automatically receive updates across Windows Live Messenger and Windows Live Spaces.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1136243">Windows Live Contacts</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1173510">Windows Live Contacts</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="24607_1136282_1173507"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Windows Live service that lets people and groups add, manage, and share event information.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1136282">Windows Live Calendar</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1173507">Windows Live Calendar</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="24608_1136283_1177464"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Windows Live service that notifies someone of an event or information based on their subscription preferences. The alerts can be sent to Messenger, Mail, Hotmail, or a mobile device.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1136283">Windows Live Alerts</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1177464">Windows Live Alerts</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="24612_1973489_1978679"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The category of services that includes OneDrive, Outlook.com, and Skype.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1973489">Microsoft services</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1978679">Perkhidmatan Microsoft</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="24616_1355343_1786791"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Microsoft service that facilitates web searches.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1355343">Bing</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1786791">Bing</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="24621_1167256_1786803"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The service that allows users to translate text and web pages into different languages using the Microsoft statistical machine translation system.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1167256">Bing Translator</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1786803">Penterjemah Bing</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="24628_1143498_2174147"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Data generated as part of a business transaction by executing an activity within an application. It is characterized by an exclusive write access pattern.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1143498">activity data</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2174147">data aktiviti</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="24630_1143501_1381708"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An XML-based file in a Microsoft .NET  application  that  is used for storing application configuration settings. This file is named app.config in a Microsoft C# project.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1143501">application configuration file</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1381708">fail konfigurasi aplikasi</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="24632_1143503_1319599"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The capture mode that specifies whether capture variables that were not explicitly specified by the user are captured by value or by reference.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1143503">default capture mode</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1319599">mod tangkapan lalai</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, M