trol, grouped by department.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1262557">HAB</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1944862">HAB</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="26080_1262557_1944866"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature of Outlook that allows members of an organization to be displayed in a tree view control, grouped by department.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1262557">HAB</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1944866">buku alamat berhierarki</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="26090_1262417_2121497"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A construct that consists of an address, a binding, and a contract used for communicating with a WCF service.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1262417">endpoint</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2121497">titik tamat</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="261_169077_2187997"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A job performing one of the following log-shipping operations: backing up the transaction log of the primary database at the primary server (the backup job), copying the transaction log file to a secondary server (the copy job), or restoring the log backup to the secondary database on a secondary server (the restore job). The backup job resides on the primary server; the copy and restore jobs reside on each of the secondary servers. See also: primary database, primary server, secondary database, secondary server.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="169077">log shipping job</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2187997">tugas penghantaran log</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="2611_534973_2177231"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An article in a merge publication that can be updated only at the Publisher or at a Subscriber that uses a server subscription.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="534973">download-only article</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2177231">artikel muat turun sahaja</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="26115_1262498_1945015"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The process of bypassing the connecting IP address in the mail header for the purposes of assessing the likelihood that the message is spam and instead inspecting the previous IP address listed in the header.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1262498">skiplisting</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1945015">pelangkauan senarai</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="26122_1262547_2209565"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A column that reduces the storage requirement for null values at the cost of more overhead to retrieve nonnull values.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1262547">sparse column</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2209565">lajur jarang</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="26123_1262549_2174424"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An untyped XML representation that combines all the sparse columns of a table into a structured output.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1262549">column set</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms