essages based on specific criteria, such as flagged, containing photos, and from social networking services.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1346465">Quick views</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1358248">Paparan pantas</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="2669_153111_444232"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The number of bits transmitted every second, used as a measure of the speed at which a device, such as a modem, can transfer data.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="153111">bits per second</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="444232">bit sesaat</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="2669_153111_444233"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The number of bits transmitted every second, used as a measure of the speed at which a device, such as a modem, can transfer data.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="153111">bits per second</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="444233">bps</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="2669_153112_444232"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The number of bits transmitted every second, used as a measure of the speed at which a device, such as a modem, can transfer data.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="153112">bps</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="444232">bit sesaat</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="2669_153112_444233"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The number of bits transmitted every second, used as a measure of the speed at which a device, such as a modem, can transfer data.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="153112">bps</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="444233">bps</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="26690_1347061_1358609"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The UI label for the Hotmail quick view that displays only the email messages that originate from a social networking service such as Facebook.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1347061">Social updates</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1358609">Kemas kini sosial</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="26691_1347063_1358611"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The spam-fighting program that Hotmail runs where actual customers classify email messages as "junk" or "not junk." Because the program is by invitation only, customers who participate are highly engaged. The Hotmail team reported in 2010 that more than half of the spam fighters participate daily. Invitations to the program are extended to a cross-section of customers who reflect the broad population of Hotmail customers in several dimensions, including age of account and country or region. Under the program, Hotmail resends an actual message that was addressed to the spam fighter. One message per day at the most is sent.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1347063">Spam Fighters program</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1358611">Program Penentang Spam</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="26691_1354361_1358611"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The spam-fighting program that Hotmail runs where actual customers classify email messages as "junk" or "not junk." Because the program is by invitation only, customers who participate are highly engaged. The Hotmail team reported in 2010 that more than half of the spam fighters participate daily. Invitations to the program are extended to a cross-section of customers who reflect the broad population of Hotmail customers in several dimensions, including age of account and country or region. Under the program, Hotmail resends an actual message that was addressed to the spam fighter. One message per day at the most is sent.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1354361">Feedback Loop program</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1358611">Program Penentang Spam</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="26692_1347064_1358051"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A rating system for online games.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1347064">game rating system</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1358051">sistem penarafan permainan</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="26696_1347068_1358615"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A conversation that is displayed with other conversations in one window. The conversations are loaded into sections or tabs of the window, rather than in multiple windows.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1347068">tabbed conversation</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1358615">perbualan bertab</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="26697_1347069_1358608"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The webpage subheading for the view in Messenger that displays the social activity of friends.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1347069">social</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1358608">sosial</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="26698_1347070_1370530"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The UI label in Messenger for the aspect of the social view that displays prioritized recent social activity of friends.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1347070">highlights</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1370530">sorotan</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="26699_1347071_1358237"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An email message that has image attachements, inline images, inline video, or an inline album.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1347071">photo e-mail</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1358237">e-mel foto</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="2670_233117_2372481"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A type of project in which the customer pays a predetermined amount for the entire project.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="233117">fixed-price project</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2372481">projek harga tetap</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="2670_627844_2372481"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A type of project in which the customer pays a predetermined amount for the entire project.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="627844">fixed fee job</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2372481">projek harga tetap</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="26700_1347072_1357899"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A custom-created layout of photos in an album.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1347072">arrangement</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1357899">susunan</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="26702_1347074_1358601"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature that lets you work on your computer from a different computer.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1347074">remote connection</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1358601">sambungan jauh</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="26703_1347075_1358204"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The tooltip that is displayed when hovering over a personal folder on the Manage Folders webpage.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1347075">Personal Folder</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1358204">Folder Peribadi</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="26704_1347076_1358614"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The webpage subheading for the list of synced folders.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1347076">Synced folders</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1358614">Folder tersegerak</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="26705_1347077_1358076"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The UI element that allows users to set permissions for an item or content so that is not made available to anyone else, thus making it private.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1347077">Just me</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1358076">Hanya saya</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="26706_1347078_1358180"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The UI label for the social activity stream that Windows Live programmatically displays in a collection. Items listed may originate within a Windows Live program, service, or landing page (Messenger, OneDrive, Windows Live Photos), or in third-party activities people connect to their profiles, such as Facebook.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1347078">Messenger social</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1358180">Messenger sosial</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="26707_1347079_1358047"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To manually edit and make adjustments to your photos.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1347079">fine tune</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1358047">memperhalus</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="26708_1347080_1358054"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A metadata tag that includes GPS latitude and longitude coordinates to specify a location. Geotags are typically used to find and organise photos and videos.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1347080">geotag</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1358054">geoteg</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="26709_1347081_1358607"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To present items within a set in no established order, as opposed to ordering items by name, by date taken, by size, etc., and typically used with audio and visual media, such as album song order or photo slide shows.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1347081">shuffle</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1358607">kocok</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="26710_1347082_1358613"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature that enables users to share stories with others using their digital photos and photo management software.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1347082">storytelling</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1358613">penceritaan</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="26714_1347086_1358743"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To add a personal touch to something.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1347086">personalize</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1358743">peribadikan</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="26719_1347108_1358245"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A view that provides one-click access to a subset of email messages based on specific criteria, which include: flagged (messages that the customer has designated as requiring follow-up), photos (messages that contain photos), and social updates (messages that originate from a social networking service such as Facebook).</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1347108">quick view</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1358245">paparan pantas</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="26720_1347110_1358050"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The webpage subheading for the view in Messenger that displays someone's friends and contacts that aren't friends but that can be interacted with in Messenger (those are often legacy entries).</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1347110">friends</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1358050">rakan</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="26728_1354362_1461590"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature in Hotmail that's designed to help people get more done on the web without having to leave their inbox. Active View displays directly in the body of the email message, showing either previews to other web content or interactive elements created by the sender that let the recipient complete core tasks. A preview message example might include a reference to a file on a photo-sharing or video-sharing website that the recipient can view in the message, or package-tracking information that's extracted from a shipping website. Interactive scenarios might include rating movies and updating wish lists on movie-rental websites or responding to invitations or comments on social networking websites.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1354362">Active View</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1461590">Paparan Aktif</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="26729_1354363_1521470"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A specific reporting job that automatically checks for potential configuration, performance, and usage problems.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1354363">health rule</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1521470">peraturan kesihatan</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="26735_1354369_1988747"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An application that is meant to run on a desktop or laptop computer.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1354369">desktop application</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1988747">program desktop</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="26735_1505030_1988747"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An application that is meant to run on a desktop or laptop computer.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1505030">desktop app</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1988747">program desktop</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="26735_1986256_1988747"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An application that is meant to run on a desktop or laptop computer.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1986256">desktop program</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1988747">program desktop</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="26737_1354381_1358620"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The feature that gives users a rich way to send video messages asynchronously to another user.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1354381">Video Messages</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1358620">Mesej Video</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="26737_1354381_2058956"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The feature that gives users a rich way to send video messages asynchronously to another user.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1354381">Video Messages</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2058956">mesej video</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="26737_1815478_1358620"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The feature that gives users a rich way to send video messages asynchronously to another user.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1815478">video messages</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1358620">Mesej Video</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="26737_1815478_2058956"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The feature that gives users a rich way to send video messages asynchronously to another user.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1815478">video messages</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2058956">mesej video</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="26738_1354382_1358242"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature that enables users to access their other POP3 enabled email accounts from within their central email account.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1354382">POP aggregation</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1358242">pengagregatan POP</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="26740_1354385_1461593"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A small image that provides a visual indication of roles, contribution levels, achievements, affiliations, etc.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1354385">badge</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1461593">lencana</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="26742_1354388_1357903"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A contact list designed for use within a form for selecting contacts. Users can click a contact to select it and may make multiple selections by using CTRL+click.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1354388">contact picker</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1357903">pemilih kenalan</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="26743_1354390_1678008"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">One of the attributes that makes up presence and that indicates a person’s availability and willingness to communicate.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1354390">presence status</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1678008">status kehadiran</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="26773_1355136_3134360"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A trusted industry standard in online pharmacy verification. Established in 2003, the PharmacyChecker Verification Program helps protect consumers by ensuring that the prescription drugs they order come from qualified online pharmacies.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1355136">PharmacyChecker</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3134360">PharmacyChecker</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="26782_1355242_2780517"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A primary SharePoint Server management plan that identifies what is considered a record, what category the record belong to, where the records are stored, record retention period, and who manages the record.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1355242">file plan</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2780517">rancangan fail</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="26786_1355342_2072470"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To remove the ability of a network object to access server resources.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1355342">deactivate</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2072470">nyahaktifkan</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="26786_2283119_2072470"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To remove the ability of a network object to access server resources.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2283119">unelevate</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2072470">nyahaktifkan</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="26803_1356229_1679517"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A provider in a Web Part connection that sends data to consumers, used in connections for PerformancePoint Web Parts.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1356229">beginpoint</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1679517">titik mula</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="26804_1356707_2121529"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The user interface control in Microsoft Dynamics CRM where you can create and edit forms for an entity.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1356707">form editor</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2121529">editor borang</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="2681_169362_2197348"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A composite restore in which a database is restored in stages, with each stage corresponding to a restore sequence. The initial sequence restores the files in the primary filegroup, and, optionally, other files, to any point in time supported by the recovery model and brings the database online. Subsequent restore sequences bring remaining files to the point consistent with the database and bring them online.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="169362">piecemeal restore</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2197348">pemulihan beransur</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="26830_1356828_2209533"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A rendered page that can be slightly larger than the size specified using the InteractiveHeight and InteractiveWidth properties of a report (HTML and WinForm control).</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1356828">soft page</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2209533">halaman lembut</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="2684_82776_1294559"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Running several processes in rapid sequence within a single program, regardless of which logical method of multitasking is being used by the operating system. Because the user's sense of time is much slower than the processing speed of a computer, multitasking appears to be simultaneous, even though only one task at a time can use a computer processing cycle.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="82776">multithreading</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1294559">multijalur</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="26842_1357076_1944848"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A service that allows users to meet in virtual rooms on a server running Exchange.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1357076">Exchange Conferencing Services</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1944848">Perkhidmatan Persidangan Exchange</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="26843_1357077_1786826"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A type of search which is restricted to a specific domain, such as news search, image search, local search.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1357077">vertical search</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1786826">carian menegak</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="2685_530420_2179993"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A user who receives the alert if the designated operator cannot be reached.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="530420">fail-safe operator</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2179993">operator gagal-selamat</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="26871_1357916_2209534"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A rendering extension that maintains the report layout and formatting so that the resulting file is optimized for screen-based viewing and delivery, such as on a Web page or in the ReportViewer controls.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1357916">soft page-break renderer</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2209534">pengemas pemisah halaman lembut</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="26871_2482869_2209534"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A rendering extension that maintains the report layout and formatting so that the resulting file is optimized for screen-based viewing and delivery, such as on a Web page or in the ReportViewer controls.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2482869">SPB renderer</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2209534">pengemas pemisah halaman lembut</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="26872_1357919_2182738"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A render