s of gathering and distributing data. Input is data that is acquired from a device or entered by the user through a device. Output is data that is sent to a device.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="63130">I/O</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="443656">input/output</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="2711_63131_443655"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The complementary tasks of gathering and distributing data. Input is data that is acquired from a device or entered by the user through a device. Output is data that is sent to a device.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="63131">input/output</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="443655">I/O</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="2711_63131_443656"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The complementary tasks of gathering and distributing data. Input is data that is acquired from a device or entered by the user through a device. Output is data that is sent to a device.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="63131">input/output</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><ter