f services designed to help evaluate organizations' environments, develop customized Microsoft SharePoint deployment plans, and that is part of software assurance coverage.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1673938">SDPS</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2726782">SDPS</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="28405_1673938_2726784"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The set of services designed to help evaluate organizations' environments, develop customized Microsoft SharePoint deployment plans, and that is part of software assurance coverage.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1673938">SDPS</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2726784">Perkhidmatan Rancangan Pengerahan SharePoint</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="28406_1484854_2726776"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Software Assurance benefit delivered by Microsoft Certified Partner that consists of one to fifteen days of planning the deployment of Microsoft Office Software for a specific organization.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1484854">Microsoft Desktop Deployment Planning Services</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2726776">Perkhidmatan Rancangan Pengerahan Desktop Microsoft</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="28411_1485413_1678016"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A user of public IM service providers, or providers and servers that use Extensible Messaging and Presence Protocol (XMPP), who has credentials and who therefore is handled as authenticated.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1485413">public user</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1678016">pengguna awam</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="28424_1486589_2174466"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A SQL Server database that includes all of the user authentication, database settings, and metadata required to define and access the database, and has no configuration dependencies on the instance of the SQL Server Database Engine where the database is installed.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1486589">contained database</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2174466">pangkalan data lengkap</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="28426_1486692_2208449"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An entity that represents a service at the Key Distribution Center (KDC). The service principal has a name and an associated key. A subclass of principal, a service principal generally does not correspond to a human user of the system, but rather to an automated service providing a resource, such as a file server.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1486692">service principal</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2208449">prinsipal perkhidmatan</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="28429_1487164_2188486"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A visual indicator that identifies a data point. In a map report, a marker is the visual indicator that identifies the location of each point on the point layer.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1487164">marker</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2188486">penanda</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="28430_1487165_2197369"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The layer in a map report that displays spatial data as points, for examples, points that indicate cities or points of interest.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1487165">point layer</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2197369">lapisan titik</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="28431_1487166_2197389"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The layer in a map report that displays spatial data as areas, for example, areas that indicate geographical regions such as counties.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1487166">polygon layer</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2197389">lapisan poligon</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="28432_1487167_2197370"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A needle, marker, or bar that indicates a single value displayed against a scale on a report.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1487167">pointer</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2197370">penunjuk</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="28435_1487377_2197350"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To rotate a table-valued expression by turning the unique values from one column in the expression into multiple columns in the output, and perform aggregations where they are required on any remaining column values that are wanted in the final output.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1487377">pivot</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2197350">pangsi</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="2845_535392_2211362"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A database at the Subscriber that receives data and database objects published by a Publisher.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="535392">subscription database</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2211362">pangkalan data langganan</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="28459_1488400_2001701"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To convert a nested structure into a flat structure.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig