oun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1586098">hubungan</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="30989_1584352_1586104"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Pertaining to a user presence state of being unavailable.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1584352">offline</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1586104">luar talian</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="30989_1585151_1586104"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Pertaining to a user presence state of being unavailable.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1585151">off the grid</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1586104">luar talian</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="3099_72029_443706"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The process of aligning text along both the left and right margins.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><