hicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="32464_1681335_1912203"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Denotes the experience with Lync that can be scheduled, or ad-hoc. A Lync Meeting provides the ability to interact with people through video, audio, instant messaging, and content sharing.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1681335">Lync Meeting</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1912203">Mesyuarat Lync</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="32466_1681337_1915655"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Alerts to Lync users about the quality of the network, computer, camera, and lighting conditions.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1681337">video quality notifications</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1915655">pemberitahuan kualiti video</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="32468_1681339_1915595"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The feature that lets users create and share OneNote meeting notes in a Lyn