ssociated with a SharePoint site, enabling users to access documents and email related to group projects through either Outlook or SharePoint.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1709128">site mailbox</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1915630">peti mel laman</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="32884_1710098_1722246"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An edition of Windows 8 Pro that contains Windows Media Center.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1710098">Windows 8 Pro with Media Center</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1722246">Windows 8 Pro with Media Center</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="32885_1713270_1915503"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature in the PowerPivot add-in for Excel that identifies the categories of data in your Excel workbook (such as cities, sports teams, or animals), sends those data categories online to Microsoft, and recommends other sets of similar data that might interest you.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1713270">Microsoft Data Categorization and Recommendation Service</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Si