 their children with controlled access to their phones. In Kid's Corner, kids can only use the apps, games, and other content that parents select.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1803746">Kid's Corner</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1846562">Sudut Kanak-kanak</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="33594_1803747_1846563"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">List of the top players in a game or other competition on Xbox Live.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1803747">leaderboard</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1846563">papan pendahulu</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="33594_3144583_1846563"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">List of the top players in a game or other competition on Xbox Live.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3144583">Xbox leaderboard</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1846563">papan pendahulu</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSe