riends, invites, chat, etc.).</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1991474">Kinect Guide</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2917951">Panduan Kinect</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="34365_1991475_2917956"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Kinect based troubleshooter that helps users with common problems related to the play space, lighting, speech/audio, setup, and hardware errors.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1991475">Kinect Tuner</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2917956">Penala Kinect</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="34366_1991476_2917981"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Disc used for playing games.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1991476">game disc</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2917981">cakera permainan</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSe