ote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39864_2322624_2327417"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The wireless personal area network technology, launched in 2010 and marketed as Bluetooth Smart, used for transmitting data over distances as much as 100 meters. Cost and power consumption are low while maintaining a communication range similar to Bluetooth BR/EDR, the other widely-used version of Bluetooth</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2322624">Bluetooth Smart</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2327417">Bluetooth Smart</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39866_2315181_2321601"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A Bluetooth Low Energy device that sends static information, such as location or ID, to devices within its area.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2315181">beacon</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2321601">mata arah</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39872_2315208_2643639"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A scoping container for a set of messaging entities.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2315208">namespace</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2643639">ruang nama perkhidmatan</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39872_2465861_2643639"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A scoping container for a set of messaging entities.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2465861">service namespace</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2643639">ruang nama perkhidmatan</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39875_2315585_2316101"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A tool that reports performance of transactions, informing about which interpreted stored procedures in the database will benefit from porting to use native compilation. After identifying theses procedures, this tool can be used to help migrate the interpreted stored procedure to native compilation. To find out more about natively compiled stored procedures, see: https://msdn.microsoft.com/en-gb/library/dn133184.aspx</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2315585">Native Compilation Advisor</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2316101">Penasihat Kompilasi Asal</term><termNot