ion with the Kinect.​​​</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2328172">scanning booth</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2328813">petak pengimbasan</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40036_2328173_2328823"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A circular revolving platform where you can place an object for 3D scanning.​​</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2328173">turntable</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2328823">meja putar</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40037_2328194_2328812"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The multi-app package for Windows 10 that includes the Messaging app for SMS, instant messaging, and Skype chat, and the Skype video app for VoIP video and audio calling.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2328194">Messaging + Skype</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2328812">Pemesejan + Skype</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote t