ices instances and author interactive reports and dashboards based on role membership on that instance.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2348758">Power BI Analysis Services Connector</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2348993">Power BI Analysis Services Connector</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40436_2349281_2351817"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A menu item showing hearts (number of likes) for a given chat message. The heart-feature refers to giving and removing hearts and is distinct from the Like-feature known from e.g. Facebook.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2349281">Show likes</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2351817">Tunjukkan sukaan</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40438_2349283_2351818"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A menu item connected the heart-feature, whereby a participant can remove a "heart" from a chat message, indicating that the participant does not like a chat message. The heart-feature refers to giving and removing hearts and is distinct from the Like-feature known from e.g. Facebook.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2349283">Unlike</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2351818">Batalkan sukaan</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40439_2349284_2351812"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An amount of money added to an account.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2349284">credit</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2351812">kredit</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40440_2349285_2351814"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A menu item connected the heart-feature, whereby a participant can give a "heart" to a chat message, indicating that the participant likes a chat message. The heart-feature refers to giving and removing hearts and is distinct from the Like-feature known from e.g. Facebook.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2349285">Like</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2351814">Suka</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40441_2349286_2351815"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A list of hearts showing how many particpant have liked a chat message. The heart-feature refers to giving and removing hearts and is distinct from the Like-feature known from e.g. Facebook.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2349286">Likes</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2351815">Sukaan</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40449_2350535_2421518"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Azure service for virtual machines (VMs) that helps address organizational security and compliance requirements by encrypting the VM boot and data disks with keys and policies that are controlled in Azure Key Vault.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2350535">Azure Disk Encryption</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2421518">Penyulitan Cakera Azure</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40449_2901999_2421518"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Azure service for virtual machines (VMs) that helps address organizational security and compliance requirements by encrypting the VM boot and data disks with keys and policies that are controlled in Azure Key Vault.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2901999">ADE</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2421518">Penyulitan Cakera Azure</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="4045_475243_2121631"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A security access level that allows a user access to record types in the user's business unit and all business units subordinate to the user's business unit.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="475243">Parent: Child Business Units</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Other</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2121631">Induk: Unit Perniagaan Anak</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40454_3113359_3114059"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The security service that provides a consolidated view into risk events and potential vulnerabilities affecting your organization’s identities.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3113359">Microsoft Entra ID Protection</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3114059">Microsoft Entra ID Protection</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage"