 quality of service due to an unexpected failure or interruption in use or functioning of a service impacting consumers.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2391816">app outage</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2393393">gangguan aplikasi</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="42262_2391817_2393396"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A customized shortened URL used for tweets, leaving room for text to use the business brand in the link.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2391817">branded URL</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2393396">URL pendek</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="42267_2391822_2393403"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The serious vulnerability that affects HTTPS and other services that rely on SSL and TLS, allowing attackers to break the encryption and read or steal sensitive information.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2391822">DROWN</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2393403">DROWN</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="