ed</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="4427_297178_444736"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Software that changes browser settings, such as the home page, without adequate consent.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="297178">browser modifier</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="444736">pengubah suai pelayar</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44282_2488643_2493781"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Microsoft app that intercepts HTTP links to Office documents when users click on them and gives the link to the Word, Excel or PowerPoint app to open.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2488643">Microsoft Office Helper</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2493781">Pembantu Microsoft Office</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44283_2488671_2493765"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The area in Outlook Customer Manager where the most important deals and information on those deals are displayed.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2488671">Focused</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNot