otSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44344_2490015_2516005"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An award granted based on a fantasy sales team member's position on the leaderboard for a specified KPI.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2490015">weekly award</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2516005">anugerah mingguan</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44349_2490693_2499130"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Outlook feature that allows users to select a later time to automatically deliver emails and where said emails are stored in the Drafts folder until the time selected for sending.​</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2490693">Send Later</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2499130">Hantar Kemudian</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44350_2490694_2502415"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The value that Excel returns when a formula returns an array of values and one or more of the cells it would spill to already has content.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2490694">#NOSPILL!</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote>