a.html, that file may be returned by a Web request for http://miles.foo.com/baz/elena.html.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="129910">virtual path</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1294649">laluan maya</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44940_2531361_2536454"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The emoticon depicting two hands in praying position.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2531361">praying</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2536454">Tangan bersentuhan</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44941_2531362_2536455"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The emoticon depicting a person making the promise sign.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2531362">promise</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2536455">Janji</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></lang