ected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="45158_2550043_2551140"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The filter that users can apply to a photo or video clip, which gives it a golden brownish hue like sand.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2550043">Sandy</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2551140">Berpasir</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="45159_2550044_2551132"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The filter that users can apply to a photo or video clip, which gives it a cheerful, playful, sunny feeling. This is also the name of a theme that applies this filter along with a related text style and music.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2550044">Joy</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2551132">Riang Ria</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="45160_2550045_2551121"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The filter that users can apply to a photo or video clip, which gives it a yellow tone.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2550045">Citrus</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termN