">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2813590">perkhidmatan Carian</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="4574_187389_1294656"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A method that frees resources and performs other cleanup operations.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="187389">finalizer</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1294656">pemuktamad</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="4575_237262_1294657"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The review of work products associated with key milestones to confirm quality and effective project processes. -</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="237262">post-milestone review</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1294657">semakan pasca pencapaian penting</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="45789_2579453_2584419"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The extension for Cortana that connects users to custom services and solutions. Skills can be invoked on Cortana to perform certain actions, such as checking the user’s bank balance, reading a bed time story, or booking a cab with Uber.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2579453">Cortana skill</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2584419">kemahiran Cortana</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="4579_181726_2205602"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The collection of task permissions associated with a role.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="181726">role definition</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2205602">peranan definisi</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="45790_2579456_2584420"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A collection of policy settings that control updates for devices that use Windows 10. With these settings, information technology administrators decide when and which devices receive updates in their organization, and set different schedules for groups of devices. They can also pause updates for individual devices.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2579456">Windows Update for Business</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2584420">Windows Update untuk Perniagaan</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="45792_2579483_2873954"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A segment for which both static and dynamic profiles are combined.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2579483">compound segment</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2873954">segmen majmuk</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="45793_2579484_2873960"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A segment that is refreshed automatically. Dynamic segments are defined by rules and their contents change over time.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2579484">dynamic segment</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2873960">segmen dinamik</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="45794_2579485_2814511"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A result of a business initiative.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2579485">business outcome</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2814511">hasil perniagaan</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="45795_2579486_2814515"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A classification that allows users to identify attribute profiles as A, B, or C for the prediction being generated and enables users to efficiently plan targeted follow-ups.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2579486">grade</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2814515">gred</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="45796_2579487_2814517"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A match that indicates the prediction policy was not able to map the different data sources to the same entity, but the likelihood the match is accurate and relevant is high.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2579487">inferred match</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2814517">padanan teragak</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="gramma