). The VBS service in Windows 10 uses hardware virtualization features to create and isolate a secure region of memory from the normal operating system.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2612185">Core isolation</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2612405">Pemencilan teras</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="46354_2612186_2612409"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A group of open tabs, including applications, files, pages, or websites, which can be saved together and re-opened together when you want to continue with that set of tabs.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2612186">set</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2612409">set</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="46355_2612189_2612410"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The most important person in a video that you create using the video remix feature in Microsoft Photos. When ​the user selects a person as the "star," then photos and video clip​s of that person will be featured more prominently than other content in the video.​</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2612189">star</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">