 to streamline the approval process by means of an automated workflow to quickly process approval requests.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2621360">Approvals Center</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2644934">Pusat Kelulusan</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="46589_3012563_3012711"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Windows 10/11 feature that allows users to choose which notifications they would like to see and hear so they can stay focused. The rest will go to action center and can be viewed any time.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3012563">focus</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3012711">fokus</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="46593_2621605_2622271"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Primary and secondary education in the United States, Canada, and Australia, i.e. kindergarten through 12th grade - the final year of high school.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2621605">K-12</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2622271">Sekolah Rendah dan Menengah</ter