, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="48482_2917812_2743088"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Pertaining to authentication means that do not require a password.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2917812">passwordless</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2743088">tanpa kata laluan</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="48485_2741340_2743089"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A means of authentication in which key-based authentication is used to enable a user credential that is tied to a device and the users are not required to provide a password.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2741340">password-less authentication</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2743089">pengesahan tanpa kata laluan</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="48485_2917816_2743089"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A means of authentication in which key-based authentication is used to enable a user credential that is tied to a devic