">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="49806_2816698_2817827"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The feature of Microsoft Teams that assesses the Office 365 tenant environment and identifies the most common configurations that may need to be updated or modified, and creates a Service management team with channels for each workload.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2816698">Advisor</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2817827">Penasihat</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="49806_2816698_2817829"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The feature of Microsoft Teams that assesses the Office 365 tenant environment and identifies the most common configurations that may need to be updated or modified, and creates a Service management team with channels for each workload.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2816698">Advisor</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2817829">Penasihat untuk Teams</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="49808_2816676_2817886"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">In Microsoft Teams, as part of Teams rollout done with Advisor for Teams, a workload is a set of features and settings that is used to deploy a specific collection of functions. Workloads are comprised of channels to complete the deployment of the functions.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2816676">workload</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2817886">beban kerja</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="49810_2816681_2817873"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To convert a phone number to a different format, by using a set of rules.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2816681">translate</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2817873">terjemah</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="49811_2816684_2817906"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">In the Microsoft 365 Admin Center, a specific network architecture design change that is recommended to improve user experience related to network connectivity to Office 365.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2816684">network insight</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></lang