phicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="4986_37166_1182972"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A device capable of processing information, storing data, and producing a desired result based on instructions provided.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="37166">computer</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1182972">komputer</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="49860_2819434_2828164"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The MMD device profile that offers the greatest power to the local user (ability to install apps, etc.). Intended for use typically by developers, field engineers, etc.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2819434">Power user device profile</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2828164">profil peranti Pengguna mahir</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="49861_2819436_2828173"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The MMD device profile that is more &amp;quot;locked down&amp;quot; to preserve the security of sensitive data. Intended for handling sensitive data such as medical records.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2819436">Sensitive data device profile</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2828173">profil peranti Data sensitif</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="49862_2819437_2828176"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The MMD device profile that has the most balance of user privileges and data security--expected to be the most common profile and used by typical information workers.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2819437">Standard device profile</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2828176">profil peranti Standard</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="49863_2911838_2912355"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Microsoft Managed Desktop device profile optimized for use by frontline workers. Limited power for the user; intended for scenarios with multiple users sharing the same device, such as at a nurses' station. Likely to be operating under the F1 license.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2911838">frontline device profile</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNot