 a project in a Team Foundation Server. Types are composed of fields, a form and work flow. They are defined using XML. Definitions are portable between Team Foundation Servers.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="543579">work item type</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1294698">jenis item kerja</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="51221_2889262_2889592"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A column that is not associated with an of XML schema.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2889262">untyped column</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2889592">lajur tanpa jenis</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="51222_2889280_2889588"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature that allows you to update only the data that has changed in order to improve the speed of refresh for large tables.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2889280">incremental refresh</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2889588">segar semula tokokan</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="par