pe="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2890322">Mod Had Bateri</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="51237_2889601_2890325"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature that helps protect a battery from the cumulative negative effects of consistent and recurrent use at high temperatures or high states of charge by monitoring battery conditions continuously and implementing a limited number of permanent reductions in charging voltage if these adverse conditions are detected.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2889601">Battery Lifespan Saver</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2890325">Penjimat Jangka Hayat Bateri</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="51248_2890599_2913531"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Southeast Brazilian region, located in Rio de Janeiro, within the Azure region taxonomy.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2890599">BR Southeast</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2913531">Tenggara Brazil</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfS