ty vulnerabilities.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3014861">Security Program for Nonprofits</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3014932">Program Keselamatan untuk Organisasi Tanpa Untung</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53036_3014863_3014928"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A collaborative web-app (MetaOS-based) which lets Office.com users convert Word/Excel/PowerPoint documents to PDF format.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3014863">PDF Tools</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3014928">Alat PDF</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53037_3014864_3014916"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A paid feature within the Microsoft 365 admin center that enables admins to do fast, at-scale point-in-time restore across OneDrive, SharePoint, and Exchange in Microsoft 365, beyond our default retention limits.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3014864">enhanced restore</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3014916">pemulihan dipertingkat</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53038_3014879_3014919"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The feature in Microsoft Teams that provides different experiences for attendees and presenters when joining an event/meeting. Attendees will see a waiting screen and will stay on that screen till presenters activate the event/meeting. Presenters will join the meeting in a separate space where they can prepare together before the event goes live for attendees.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3014879">green room</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3014919">bilik menunggu</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53039_3014880_3014915"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The first party eCDN solution that alleviates limited corporate network downlink bandwidth to deliver high-quality video streaming and broadcasting for large audiences of employees.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3014880">eCDN</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3014915">eCDN</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="5304_232831_1182977"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An add-in that stores macros, AutoText entries, and custom toolbar, menu, and shortcut key settings that you can use while you work with documents based on any template. By default, the Normal template is a global template.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="232831">global template</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1182977">templat sejagat</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="5304_232831_1433332"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An add-in that stores macros, AutoText entries, and custom toolbar, menu, and shortcut key settings that you can use while you work with documents based on any template. By default, the Normal template is a global template.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="232831">global template</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1433332">templat sejahat</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53040_3014881_3014942"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The feature within Microsoft Teams Admin Center that provides a comprehensive integrated view of Microsoft Teams Rooms (MTR) together with its related devices and connected peripherals to provide reports on room health, utilization and compliance.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3014881">workspace management</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3014942">pengurusan ruang kerja</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53041_3014882_3014929"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The PowerPoint feature that helps make your presentations more impactful through the recording of narrated videos.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3014882">recording studio</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3014929">studio rakaman</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53042_3014883_3014918"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The capability that allows customers to see all the feedback they’ve provided about Microsoft 365 and Windows products and services, the status of that feedback, and any official responses from Microsoft about the feedback. Users can also participate in community discussion with other users by upvoting and commenting.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3014883">feedback</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langS