 configure the development kit, manage users, launch installed titles, and perform captures and traces.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3043098">Dev Home</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3043393">Dev Home</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53416_3150050_3043393"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The developer app that runs on the Xbox One &amp; Xbox Series X|S development kit designed to help increase productivity by offering functionality to help manage and configure the development kit, manage users, launch installed titles, and perform captures and traces.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3150050">Developer Home</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3043393">Dev Home</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53417_3043785_3044296"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The browser extension that allows organizations to audit and manage activities users take on sensitive items on devices running Windows 10.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3043785">Microsoft Purview Extension</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp><