ic Mobility and Security</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3091257">Kemudahalihan dan Keselamatan Asas</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54170_3091308_3091561"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A type of phishing attack that uses telephony to trick users into revealing personal information.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3091308">vishing</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3091561">penipuan panggilan</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54171_3091309_3091562"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Pertaining to an organization, activity, or event that reduces the amount of carbon dioxide in the atmosphere more than it creates.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3091309">carbon negative</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3091562">negatif karbon</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote><