rvice provided within each tenant of Microsoft Fabric.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3119828">OneLake</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3120050">OneLake</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="55037_3119830_3120135"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">In Microsoft Fabric, the virtualized copy of data in the lake that all analytical engines can access.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3119830">One Copy</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3120135">One Copy</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="55048_3129686_3132153"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Unity plugin provided by the Mesh Toolkit for uploading a Mesh environment to a Mesh world.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3129686">Mesh Toolkit Uploader</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3132153">Mesh Toolkit Uploader</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><term