"grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3152151">prom Copilot</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="56006_3151345_3155778"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A collaboration feature that allows users to search and discover people across multiple tenants.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3151345">people search</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3155778">carian individu</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="56007_3151346_3155777"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature in Microsoft Entra ID and Microsoft 365 that enables users to form a tenant group within an organization.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3151346">multitenant organization</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3155777">organisasi berbilang penyewa</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="56008_3151380_3151608"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A collaboration space that can be created in Microsoft Teams to connect people from your organization and customers related to your project together in a team that includes the apps and channels you need to make progress faster.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3151380">deal room</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3151608">bilik urusan</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="56009_3151381_3151609"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A control in model-driven apps that allows users to view, open, and edit records from views and subgrids. In addition to inline editing, the control provides other capabilities including a modern data browsing experience via infinite scrolling, allowing users to scroll indefinitely through data until they find the records they're interested in, and an ability to customize the visual appearance of columns for specific needs.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3151381">grid control</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3151609">kawalan grid</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="56010_3151382_3151610"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A score that shows the overall health and trend of each of your business relationships. It is calculated by collecting the relevant activities, and weighting the activity by type. The result is normalized to produce a health score between 0 and 100, and the health characterized as good (for a score of 60-100), fair (40-59) or poor (0-39).</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3151382">health score</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3151610">skor kesihatan</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="56011_3151383_3151611"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A prompt that a user can use to catch up on the updates to their lead records since the last seven days or the last login. The catch up information is generated from the audit history.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3151383">lead catchup</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3151611">susulan bakal pelanggan</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="56012_3151384_3151612"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An AI-powered summary that allows sellers to access a quick overview of leads from various sources. This feature saves time and effort and ensures that sales teams focus on the most promising leads, leading to increased seller productivity and efficiency.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3151384">lead summary</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3151612">ringkasan bakal pelanggan</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="56013_3151385_3151613"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A prompt that a user can use to catch up on the updates to their opportunity records since the last seven days or the last login. The catch up information is generated from the audit history.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3151385">opportunity catchup</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3151613">susulan peluang</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="56014_3151386_3151614"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A summary of each opportunity generated by Sales Copilot with key information like sales stage, budget, and close date. This helps you interact better with customers and boost sales and customer satisfaction.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3151386">opportunity summary</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3151614">ringkasan peluang</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="56027_3152018_3152643"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The 2024 public preview version of Microsoft Office Professional Plus that utilizes the LTSC servicing model.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3152018">Microsoft Office LTSC Professional Plus 2024 Preview</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3152643">Microsoft Office LTSC Professional Plus 2024 Preview</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="56028_3152019_3152648"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The 2024 public preview version of Microsoft Project Professional.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3152019">Microsoft Project Professional 2024 Preview</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3152648">Microsoft Project Professional 2024 Preview</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="56029_3152020_3152650"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The 2024 public preview version of Microsoft Visio Professional that utilizes the LT