te solutions to non-critical problems (problems that do not cause programs, services, or components to stop working).</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="299918">Windows Problem Reporting</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="444757">Pelaporan Masalah Windows</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="5965_187866_1295379"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An optional file system folder that contains current copies of all files in a project. The shadow folder provides a location from which to view the files without accessing the Visual SourceSafe database and serves as a convenient place to build or compile the project.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="187866">shadow folder</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1295379">folder bayang</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="5967_25496_443360"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Pertaining to time when a person is already scheduled for another task and is not available.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="25496">busy</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp>