ing of a number of connected circuit elements, such as transistors and resistors, fabricated on a small rectangle (a "die") cut from a silicon (or, in some special cases, a sapphire) wafer. Chips are categorized by the number of elements they contain.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1054660">integrated circuit</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2519489">litar bersepadu</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="6259_1054661_2519489"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A device consisting of a number of connected circuit elements, such as transistors and resistors, fabricated on a small rectangle (a "die") cut from a silicon (or, in some special cases, a sapphire) wafer. Chips are categorized by the number of elements they contain.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1054661">IC</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2519489">litar bersepadu</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="6259_31338_2519489"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A device consisting of a number of connected circuit elements, such as transistors and resistors, fabricated on a small rectangle (a "die") cut from a silicon (or, in some special cases, a sapphire) wafer. Chips are ca