n using Business Contact Manager for Outlook and that is often listed on the Business Tools menu.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="178555">business tool</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2734499">alat perniagaan</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="8282_130280_1296202"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An environment in which you write new and edit existing Visual Basic for Applications code and procedures. The Visual Basic Editor contains a complete debugging toolset for finding syntax, run-time, and logic problems in your code.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="130280">Visual Basic Editor</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1296202">Editor Visual Basic</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="8283_153889_444236"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A derivative of the file allocation table (FAT) file system. FAT32 supports smaller cluster sizes and larger volumes than FAT, which results in more efficient space allocation on FAT32 volumes.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="153889">FAT32</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></l