. ODS library follows the tabular data stream (TDS) protocol.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="86862">ODS library</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2194750">pustaka ODS</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="8879_86862_2194759"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A set of C functions that makes an application a server. ODS library calls respond to requests from a client in a client/server network. Also manages the communication and data between the client and the server. ODS library follows the tabular data stream (TDS) protocol.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="86862">ODS library</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ms"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2194759">pustaka Perkhidmatan Data Terbuka</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BRN, MYS</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="8879_86863_2194750"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A set of C functions that makes an application a server. ODS library calls respond to requests from a client in a client/server network. Also manages the communication and data between the client and the server. ODS library follows the tabular data stream (TDS) protocol.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="86863">Open Data Services library</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun<